                "dsDescriptionValue": {
                  "typeName": "dsDescriptionValue",
                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "<p dir=\"ltr\">Hoe werkt jongerenparticipatie? En hoe kunnen gemeenten hiermee aan de slag? Het rapport ‘Jongerenparticipatie in (lokaal) beleid: wat werkt?’ geeft inzicht in de meest voorkomende uitdagingen rondom jongerenparticipatie en hoe gemeenten jongerenparticipatie in beleid kunnen verbeteren. De inzichten zijn gebaseerd op twaalf 'best-practice' interviews met vertegenwoordigers van organisaties die zich inzetten voor het verbeteren van jongerenparticipatie in beleid.</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><b>Background</b>:<br>This report was written during a 2-year postdoc project of the Healthy Start Convergence (2023-2025). The aim of this postdoc project is to provide insight into the barriers and facilitators to youth participation in local policy. As part of this project, we interviewed representatives of 12 organizations in the Netherlands aiming to improve youth participation in local policy. The results of these interviews are presented in this report. The project was approved by the ethical committee of the Erasmus University Rotterdam, Department of Public Administration and Sociology, reference number: ETH2223-0661.</p><p><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\">For more information about the Healthy Start Convergence, please visit: <a href=\"https://convergence.nl/nl/healthy-start/.\" target=\"_blank\">https://https://convergence.nl/nl/healthy-start/.</a></p><p><br></p>"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
